b:T1823,<p>I am using vLLM's Anthropic API. The server is running Qwen3.6-27B, and this request fails:</p>
<pre class="shiki ai-infra-paper" style="background-color:#F8F7F3;color:#303638"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#3F6D55">import</span><span style="color:#303638"> anthropic</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#303638">client </span><span style="color:#3F6D55">=</span><span style="color:#303638"> anthropic</span><span style="color:#686D67">.</span><span style="color:#303638">Anthropic</span><span style="color:#686D67">(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#6E5C8A">    api_key</span><span style="color:#3F6D55">=</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">"test"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#6E5C8A">    base_url</span><span style="color:#3F6D55">=</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">"http://localhost:8000"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#303638">messages </span><span style="color:#3F6D55">=</span><span style="color:#686D67"> [</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    {</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">"role"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "system"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "content"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "You are a helpful assistant."</span><span style="color:#686D67">},</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    {</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">"role"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "user"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "content"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "Please check the GPU status for vLLM."</span><span style="color:#686D67">},</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    {</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">"role"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "assistant"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "content"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "Sure, I will check it."</span><span style="color:#686D67">},</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    {</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">"role"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "user"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "content"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "Show me the nvidia-smi output."</span><span style="color:#686D67">},</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    {</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">"role"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "assistant"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "content"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "The GPU status looks normal, with utilization around 15%."</span><span style="color:#686D67">},</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    {</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">"role"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "user"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "content"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "Write up the results as a report."</span><span style="color:#686D67">},</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    {</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">"role"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "system"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "content"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "Task instruction: Based on the conversation above, generate a brief GPU status report."</span><span style="color:#686D67">},</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    {</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">"role"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "user"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "content"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "Please summarize the above."</span><span style="color:#686D67">},</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">]</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#303638">client</span><span style="color:#686D67">.</span><span style="color:#303638">messages</span><span style="color:#686D67">.</span><span style="color:#303638">create</span><span style="color:#686D67">(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#6E5C8A">    model</span><span style="color:#3F6D55">=</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">"Qwen3.6-27B"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#6E5C8A">    max_tokens</span><span style="color:#3F6D55">=</span><span style="color:#2D6F7A">512</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#6E5C8A">    messages</span><span style="color:#3F6D55">=</span><span style="color:#303638">messages</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">)</span></span></code></pre>
<p>The SDK receives HTTP 500 from vLLM with this response:</p>
<pre class="shiki ai-infra-paper" style="background-color:#F8F7F3;color:#303638"><code><span class="line"><span>System message must be at the beginning.</span></span></code></pre>
<p>The conversation already begins with a system message, so this response does not make sense to me. Fix inline-system handling in Messages (streaming and non-streaming) and token counting across templates with different system-message placement rules. Preserve other already-supported message layouts for both tokenizer-default and explicitly configured templates.</p>1:["$","main",null,{"className":"task-page","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"site-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"chrome-inner","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"header-name","href":"/","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"AI Infra Bench"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Primary navigation","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"/leaderboard.html","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"Leaderboard"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"/tasks.html","aria-current":"page","children":"Tasks"}],["$","a",null,{"className":"github-link","href":"https://github.com/ai-infra-bench/ai-infra-bench","children":"GitHub"}]]}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"task-detail","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"task-detail-heading","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Anthropic Inline System Template"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Fix inline system-message handling in Anthropic Messages and token-counting requests."}]]}],["$","$La",null,{"instructionHtml":"$b","verifierFiles":[{"name":"test.sh","lineCount":23,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/tests/0.json"},{"name":"anthropic_sdk_probe.py","lineCount":116,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/tests/1.json"},{"name":"check_probe.py","lineCount":64,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/tests/2.json"},{"name":"probe_contract.py","lineCount":115,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/tests/3.json"},{"name":"run_api_checks.py","lineCount":182,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/tests/4.json"},{"name":"test_anthropic_sdk_e2e.sh","lineCount":3,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/tests/5.json"}],"solutionFiles":[{"name":"solve.sh","lineCount":5,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/solution/0.json"},{"name":"oracle.patch","lineCount":74,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/solution/1.json"}],"environmentFiles":[{"name":"Dockerfile","lineCount":732,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/environment/0.json"},{"name":"build-config.json","lineCount":7,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/environment/1.json"},{"name":"image-manifest.json","lineCount":8,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/environment/2.json"},{"name":"lock/extras.in","lineCount":8,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/environment/3.json"},{"name":"lock/manifest.json","lineCount":38,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/environment/4.json"},{"name":"lock/requirements.txt","lineCount":570,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-anthropic-inline-system-template/environment/5.json"}],"metadataGroups":[{"title":"Task","facts":[["Task Type","Bug fix"],["Keywords","anthropic, chat-template, token-counting"]]},{"title":"Compute","facts":[["GPUs","0"],["CPUs","8 cores"],["Memory","16 GB"],["Storage","50 GB"],["Network","No network"],["Working directory","/workspace/vllm"],["Build timeout","180 min"]]},{"title":"Execution","facts":[["Agent Timeout","600 min"],["Agent User","root"],["Agent Network","No network"],["Verifier Timeout","120 min"]]}]}]]}],"$Lc"]}]
